{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38940","headline":"秋日山中寄池州李常侍 · 杜荀鹤","name":"秋日山中寄池州李常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近来参谒陡生疎，因向云山僻处居。\n出爲羁孤营粝食，归同弟侄读生书。\n风凋古木秋阴薄，月满寒山夜景虚。\n但得中兴知己在，算应身未老樵渔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}